{"bvid": "BV1E44y1U7mD", "title": "地道口语必学-“影子跟读法” | 90%的同学都做错了“影子跟读法”的步骤", "duration": 641, "subs": [{"cid": 921479510, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 278, "body": [{"from": 0.06, "to": 0.87, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "老师老师", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 0.87, "to": 3.06, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "为什么我已经做了好几个月", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.06, "to": 6.43, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "甚至更长时间的shadowing影子跟读法了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 6.43, "to": 9.2, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "但是我这个发音并没有任何的进步呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 9.2, "to": 11.27, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "到底是哪里出了问题呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.27, "to": 12.86, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "是我用的方法不对吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.86, "to": 15.2, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "还是这个方法本身就有问题呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.04, "to": 17.72, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "Hello", "music": 0.26086950850662455}, {"from": 17.72, "to": 18.02, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "大家好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.02, "to": 19.37, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "我是牟婷老师", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.37, "to": 22.28, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "那今天这个视频呢就要来给大家解决一个", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 22.28, "to": 25.22, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "关于shadowing影子跟读法的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.22, "to": 27.02, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "那什么是影子跟读法呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 27.02, "to": 30.02, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "就是呢我们知道在学习语言的过程当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.02, "to": 33.509, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "是需要不断的去抹模仿native speaker讲话了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.509, "to": 35.939, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "这样才能让我们的发音更加的地道", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 35.939, "to": 38.42, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "让我们的用词用句更加的正确", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 38.42, "to": 41.84, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "所以很多同学会选择这样去模仿去跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 41.84, "to": 44.96, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "也就是呢尽量的达到跟原文啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 44.96, "to": 48.44, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "能够像一样如影随形的那种感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 48.44, "to": 50.24, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "但是实际操作过程当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 50.24, "to": 53.56, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "很多同学对shadow的方法其实做的都不太对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.56, "to": 57.16, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "就会造成刚刚前面类似于那个同学的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 57.16, "to": 59.739, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "就是做了很久并没有什么提升", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.739, "to": 61.659, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "其实主要的问题就出在两个地方", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.659, "to": 64.709, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "一个就是选择的材料可能并不是特别的适合", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 64.709, "to": 68.789, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "或者这个材料的一个分段的练习不太对待", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 68.789, "to": 70.46, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "会我们具体来讲讲怎么区分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 70.46, "to": 73.28, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "然后第二个呢就是我们刚刚提到过的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 73.28, "to": 74.66, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "shadow里的步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.66, "to": 76.0, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "其实出现的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 76.0, "to": 79.3, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "效果这个方法呢本身并没有什么太大的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.3, "to": 81.94, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "虽然我知道在学术界还是有一定的争议的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 81.94, "to": 83.14, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "但主要的争议其实就是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.14, "to": 86.43, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "因为很多同学的这个使用步骤不太对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.43, "to": 88.32, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "所以误用了这个方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 88.32, "to": 90.45, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "本身这个方法我觉得还是相当不错的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 90.45, "to": 93.1, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "我也会经常让同学们去做这样的一些练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.1, "to": 95.889, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "用我的这个托福满分口语的示范音频", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 95.889, "to": 97.689, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "或者是用大家喜欢的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.689, "to": 99.189, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "我也推荐过很多次的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 99.189, "to": 101.469, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "一些YOUTUBE上面的一些油管博主", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.469, "to": 104.02, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "他们示范的一些视频作为材料都是OK的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.02, "to": 106.72, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "所以接下来咱们来解决这两个关键的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 106.72, "to": 109.33, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "首先第一个关于选择材料的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 109.33, "to": 110.77, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "选择材料的话呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.77, "to": 113.47, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "一方面选择自己比较感兴趣的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.47, "to": 117.11, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "你想要成为他那样讲话方式的人呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 117.11, "to": 119.42, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "比如说如果你喜欢卡戴珊对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.42, "to": 123.38, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "那你可以去模仿卡戴珊的那样的一些发音啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 123.38, "to": 124.55, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "他讲的那些句子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 124.55, "to": 127.34, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "或者像有的同学他喜欢有一些数学家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.34, "to": 129.47, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "比较学术的一些大脑型的人物", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 129.47, "to": 130.91, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "然后他们的一些演讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 130.91, "to": 134.3, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "他拿它来做一些跟读的一些示范也是OK的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 134.3, "to": 135.5, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "但是大家要注意", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 135.5, "to": 137.54, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "肯定要根据自己的水平来对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 137.54, "to": 139.71, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "比如说如果你现在的英语水平", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 139.71, "to": 142.17, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "这托福还停留在五六十分的状态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 142.17, "to": 145.59, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "那你肯定就不太适合去拿那种过于学术的内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 145.59, "to": 147.079, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "来做一个跟读的素材", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 147.079, "to": 149.599, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "那你可能就从一些生活一点的对话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 149.599, "to": 153.31, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "比如说一些VLOG的一些视频来开始是更好的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 153.31, "to": 155.59, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "然后慢慢的等水平提高了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 155.59, "to": 157.709, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "可以增加一些学术的一些跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 157.709, "to": 160.619, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "或者跟着老师的满分示范的音频去走", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.619, "to": 161.489, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "都是可以的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 161.489, "to": 163.91, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "所以首先要选择适合自己的难度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 163.91, "to": 167.56, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "然后第二个呢要选择的是适合自己的长度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 167.56, "to": 169.12, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "从一开始的时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 169.12, "to": 170.71, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "我们在做跟读的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.71, "to": 174.25, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "尽量可能3~4个单词就要暂停一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.25, "to": 175.55, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "要去模仿了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 175.55, "to": 177.95, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "而不要等到一整句话讲完", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 177.95, "to": 180.2, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "因为你可能有点来不及对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 180.2, "to": 181.85, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "那或者你整句话你听完", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 181.85, "to": 183.65, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "你可能就有点忘记前面的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 183.65, "to": 184.8, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "只记得后面的了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 184.8, "to": 187.26, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "所以我们循序渐进地增加自己", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 187.26, "to": 189.12, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "模仿跟读的这样的一个难度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 189.12, "to": 191.06, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "从一开始三四个词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 191.06, "to": 193.64, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "然后慢慢的到更长的句子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 193.64, "to": 197.83, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "或者是从句里面又有从句的那种超不长的句子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 197.83, "to": 199.41, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "去做一个模仿和示范", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 199.41, "to": 202.44, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "所以我们一要挑选适合自己难度的材料", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 202.44, "to": 206.32, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "二要注意一下循序渐进的句子长度的模仿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 206.32, "to": 208.21, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "OK所以这是解决了第一个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.21, "to": 210.16, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "关于我们挑选材料的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.16, "to": 214.26, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "那第二个更加重要的就是我们shadow的步骤了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 214.26, "to": 215.34, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "这个步骤呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 215.34, "to": 218.82, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "很多同学就是拿到了一段视频或者一段音频", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 218.82, "to": 220.26, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "然后就直接开始跟读啦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 220.26, "to": 221.31, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "巴拉巴拉巴拉巴拉巴拉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 221.31, "to": 223.23, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "但这种时候你往往会发现", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 223.23, "to": 224.25, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "你其实啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 224.25, "to": 228.36, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "还是沉浸在自己的讲话的这种感觉当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 228.36, "to": 231.33, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "而没有真的去听别人再怎么讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 231.33, "to": 232.1, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "你懂吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 232.1, "to": 233.0, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "就别人怎么讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 233.0, "to": 235.37, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "你压根儿你可能就因为很乱嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.37, "to": 237.26, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "人家刚讲一句一个词儿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 237.26, "to": 238.87, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "你可能就跟上去了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 238.87, "to": 241.64, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "这你压根就听不清人家后面是怎么讲的呀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 241.64, "to": 243.08, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "过于仓促了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 243.08, "to": 243.56, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "对不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 243.56, "to": 246.44, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "所以这样你去shadowing肯定就没有什么效果", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 246.44, "to": 249.83, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "所以呢按照我们学术界口语言学家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 249.83, "to": 251.12, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "他们这样去推荐哈", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 251.12, "to": 253.72, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "其实是应该分成这样的几个阶段的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 253.72, "to": 255.22, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "首先第一个阶段啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 255.22, "to": 258.539, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "你们在跟读之前最好呢先看一看", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 258.539, "to": 261.569, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "或者你先听一遍他讲的这个内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 261.569, "to": 263.23, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "大体讲的是一个什么样的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 263.23, "to": 264.67, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "所以你先了解一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 264.67, "to": 266.2, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "作为一个背景知识", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 266.2, "to": 267.81, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "基础内容的铺垫", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 267.81, "to": 269.55, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "不要呢你在跟读的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.55, "to": 271.44, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "又不能理解他原文的内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 271.44, "to": 274.35, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢又可能跟不上他在讲一些什么样的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 274.35, "to": 276.18, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "所以你可以先了解他讲的内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 276.18, "to": 278.83, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "或者把他的那个稿子打印出来对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 278.83, "to": 280.81, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "或者下载下来自己先过一遍", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 280.81, "to": 282.43, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "看一遍都是没有问题的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 282.43, "to": 284.8, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "那第二个阶段呢重点来了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 284.8, "to": 287.38, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "它是这样的三个步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 287.38, "to": 289.42, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "首先第一就是listen", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 289.42, "to": 290.26, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "就是我讲了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 290.26, "to": 292.68, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "比如说你listen three to four wor", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 292.68, "to": 294.24, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "或者是你基础比较好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 294.24, "to": 295.14, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "程度比较好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 295.14, "to": 298.62, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "那你可以呢这个听一个完整的句子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 298.62, "to": 300.24, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "listen之后呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 300.24, "to": 302.24, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "不要先着急跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 302.24, "to": 304.1, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "你先暂停了之后呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 304.1, "to": 305.48, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "你先停一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 305.48, "to": 307.1, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "这个时候我们要做一件事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 307.1, "to": 308.15, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "叫做echo", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 308.15, "to": 312.11, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "我们要利用我们大脑里面的the echo effect", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 312.11, "to": 315.1, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "也就是大脑里面的那个回声效应", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 315.1, "to": 316.12, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "什么是回声效应", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 316.12, "to": 316.36, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "能", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 316.36, "to": 318.34, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "就是你刚听完别人的一句话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 318.34, "to": 321.55, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "你先不要急着自己去表达什么样的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 321.55, "to": 322.75, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "你听完了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 322.75, "to": 324.46, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "你会发现你的脑袋里面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 324.46, "to": 326.83, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "它会一直有点盘旋这句话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 326.83, "to": 328.45, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "所以就像一个回音一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 328.45, "to": 329.58, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "像个echo一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 329.58, "to": 332.539, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "这样的话它可以加深在你大脑里面的印象", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 332.539, "to": 334.429, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "然后你echo完了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 334.429, "to": 336.289, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "你再去模仿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 336.289, "to": 342.03, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "所以是listen echo repeat是这样的三个步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 342.03, "to": 344.88, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "因此千万不要边听边说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 344.88, "to": 346.77, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "OK所以这是我们的第二个阶段", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 346.77, "to": 348.81, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "就是你已经比较熟练了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 348.81, "to": 351.12, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "已经掌握了它的文本里面的内容了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 351.12, "to": 353.58, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "你就可以做这个第二个阶段的事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 353.58, "to": 356.54, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "listen echo and repeat好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.54, "to": 358.73, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "然后接下来第三个阶段呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 358.73, "to": 360.59, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "因为你已经echo很熟了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 360.59, "to": 362.32, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "你自己也讲过模仿过了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 362.32, "to": 365.11, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "所以我们可以再去掉echo的这个部分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 365.11, "to": 367.81, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "直接listen and repeat", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 367.81, "to": 369.82, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "OK所以这是我们的第三个阶段", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 369.82, "to": 373.09, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "听了一句或者3~4个单词之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 373.09, "to": 374.35, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "直接进行模仿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 374.35, "to": 375.55, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "因为你已经很熟了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 375.55, "to": 376.58, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "理解echo过了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 376.58, "to": 381.38, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "然后第四个阶段才是要进行shadowing同步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 381.38, "to": 387.14, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "就是基本上就跟他的原文的时间速度保持一致", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 387.14, "to": 388.91, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "就比如说他讲了一句话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 388.91, "to": 391.46, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "然后你就紧跟着他说出第一个单词的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 391.46, "to": 393.53, "sid": 173, "location": 2, "content": "你就紧跟着讲那个单词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 393.53, "to": 397.34, "sid": 174, "location": 2, "content": "然后看看你跟它的整个的节奏是否是同步的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 397.34, "to": 399.17, "sid": 175, "location": 2, "content": "他结束最后一个单词的时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 399.17, "to": 401.73, "sid": 176, "location": 2, "content": "是否就是你结束最后一个单词的时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 401.73, "to": 403.62, "sid": 177, "location": 2, "content": "如果能够做到同步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 403.62, "to": 405.33, "sid": 178, "location": 2, "content": "那就说明你整体的表达", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 405.33, "to": 406.84, "sid": 179, "location": 2, "content": "是不是就已经非常的好了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 406.86, "to": 411.0, "sid": 180, "location": 2, "content": "所以一个文本其实是可以拿来反复的进行", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 411.0, "to": 412.53, "sid": 181, "location": 2, "content": "跟读的这样一些练习的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 412.53, "to": 413.9, "sid": 182, "location": 2, "content": "因此大家有没有发现", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 413.9, "to": 416.3, "sid": 183, "location": 2, "content": "很多同学的shadowing为什么会出问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 416.3, "to": 419.03, "sid": 184, "location": 2, "content": "因为前面三个步骤大部分同学都没有做", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 419.03, "to": 421.43, "sid": 185, "location": 2, "content": "直接就跳到了最后一个步骤了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 421.43, "to": 421.85, "sid": 186, "location": 2, "content": "对不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 421.85, "to": 423.41, "sid": 187, "location": 2, "content": "就直接跟着去讲了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 423.41, "to": 425.15, "sid": 188, "location": 2, "content": "那那样的效果肯定是不好的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 425.15, "to": 427.95, "sid": 189, "location": 2, "content": "你还是沉浸在自己发音的世界里面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 427.95, "to": 430.23, "sid": 190, "location": 2, "content": "所以一定要先了解文本", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 430.23, "to": 432.36, "sid": 191, "location": 2, "content": "然后listen echo repeat", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 432.36, "to": 434.23, "sid": 192, "location": 2, "content": "然后再listen repeat", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 434.23, "to": 435.77, "sid": 193, "location": 2, "content": "最后在shadow", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 435.77, "to": 439.28, "sid": 194, "location": 2, "content": "所以这其实才是一个比较完整的shadow的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 439.28, "to": 441.95, "sid": 195, "location": 2, "content": "而不要直接跳到最后一个步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 441.95, "to": 444.28, "sid": 196, "location": 2, "content": "OK那接下来咱们可以来看一下哈", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 444.28, "to": 447.07, "sid": 197, "location": 2, "content": "在台湾待了很多年的这样的一个", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 447.07, "to": 448.61, "sid": 198, "location": 2, "content": "美国的语言学家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 448.61, "to": 450.83, "sid": 199, "location": 2, "content": "他的一个现场的示范", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 450.83, "to": 452.57, "sid": 200, "location": 2, "content": "带着同学们的示范和讲解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 452.57, "to": 455.15, "sid": 201, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以参考一下他的这一段tap talk", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 455.15, "to": 456.32, "sid": 202, "location": 2, "content": "在看的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 456.32, "to": 458.81, "sid": 203, "location": 2, "content": "你们也可以跟着karen ch老师", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 458.81, "to": 461.82, "sid": 204, "location": 2, "content": "一起来做这样的一个IO的练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 463.36, "to": 465.72, "sid": 205, "location": 2, "content": "Listen echo repeat", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 465.72, "to": 467.84, "sid": 206, "location": 2, "content": "我们现在来试试看吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 468.26, "to": 471.47, "sid": 207, "location": 2, "content": "这是个很短的一段对话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 471.47, "to": 474.34, "sid": 208, "location": 2, "content": "我听一下what's that song", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 474.34, "to": 475.9, "sid": 209, "location": 2, "content": "They're playing i love it", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 476.92, "to": 478.12, "sid": 210, "location": 2, "content": "I have no idea", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 478.12, "to": 479.64, "sid": 211, "location": 2, "content": "But it is nice", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 480.08, "to": 481.22, "sid": 212, "location": 2, "content": "最后那一句", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 481.22, "to": 482.3, "sid": 213, "location": 2, "content": "But it is nice", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 482.3, "to": 483.99, "sid": 214, "location": 2, "content": "那音调比较特别", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 483.99, "to": 487.41, "sid": 215, "location": 2, "content": "你没有声音做一个范本的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 487.41, "to": 489.57, "sid": 216, "location": 2, "content": "你可能就but it is nice", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 489.57, "to": 491.1, "sid": 217, "location": 2, "content": "可能就这样子念", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 491.32, "to": 492.79, "sid": 218, "location": 2, "content": "实际上不是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 492.79, "to": 494.08, "sid": 219, "location": 2, "content": "